{"availability":"available","full":"AutoMQ/automq","name":"automq","description":"Diskless Kafka® on S3. 10x Cost-Effective. No Cross-AZ Traffic Cost. Autoscale in seconds. Single-digit ms latency. Multi-AZ Availability.","category":"Other","language":"Java","stars":10917,"forks":799,"created":"2023-08-17T07:50:13Z","updated":"2026-10-17T20:01:24Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.automq.com","topics":["automq","diskless","kafka","serverless"],"demo":"https://account.automq.cloud/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=playground","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T09:17:43.065Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T09:17:43.065Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T09:17:43.065Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T09:17:43.065Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:53.868Z","stars":10902,"forks":784},{"at":"2026-10-04T19:21:07.178Z","stars":10902,"forks":785},{"at":"2026-10-06T21:06:06.238Z","stars":10908,"forks":787},{"at":"2026-10-09T01:07:23.876Z","stars":10909,"forks":788},{"at":"2026-10-10T01:09:52.336Z","stars":10904,"forks":789},{"at":"2026-10-15T14:58:47.590Z","stars":10917,"forks":791},{"at":"2026-10-18T09:17:43.065Z","stars":10917,"forks":799}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Diskless Kafka® on S3, Offering 10x Cost Savings and Scaling in Seconds.","📑&nbsp Documentation&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp 🔥&nbsp Explore AutoMQ Playground Now&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp","AutoMQ is a stateless Kafka alternative that runs on S3 or any S3-compatible storage, such as MinIO. It is designed to address two major issues of Apache Kafka. First, Kafka clusters are difficult to scale out or in due to the stateful nature of its brokers. Data movement is required, and even reassigning partitions between brokers is a complex process. Second, hosting Kafka in the cloud can be prohibitively expensive. You face high costs for EBS storage, cross-AZ traffic, and significant over-provisioning due to Kafka's limited scalability."],"features":["From 6 Hours to Seconds: How Grab Achieved 3x Data Streaming Efficiency with AutoMQ","Tencent Cloud EMR uses AutoMQ as a first-party service","2.2B Messages a Day: LG U+ Modernizes Log Pipelines with AutoMQ on AWS","Geely: Powering Hybrid Cloud Streaming for a 10-Million-Vehicle Fleet","Bambu Lab: Unifying Multi-Cloud Data Streaming with Stateless Kafka"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AutoMQ/automq/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"aaa70b5135e05a4c437f614e7863a7860d73b2e9bca1e6229f0ae7f697607f8b","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:00:19.122Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T09:17:43.193Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-17T20:01:24Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:50:04.799Z","latestRelease":{"name":"1.7.5-rc1","tag":"1.7.5-rc1","publishedAt":"2026-09-24T04:24:02Z","url":"https://github.com/AutoMQ/automq/releases/tag/1.7.5-rc1"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:50:04.799Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/07c4c01774e9012b1f82f6ac.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-04T10:37:39.810Z","url":"https://account.automq.cloud/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=playground"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://account.automq.cloud/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=playground","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T11:56:50.235Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T10:37:39.809Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-04T10:37:39.809Z","target":"https://account.automq.cloud/?client_id=client_01JZN33F8WR1E7QTN4W6J7WYWG&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fconsole.automq.cloud%2Fauth%2Fcallback&authorization_session_id=01M437V5ZP2APCJV3BRV3GFS89","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-21T11:56:50.235Z","probeVersion":3,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":8,"error":{"reason":"login_wall","at":"2026-10-18T11:56:50.235Z"}},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Diskless Kafka® on S3, Offering 10x Cost Savings and Scaling in Seconds.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AutoMQ/automq/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":